<title>HONG KONG: Bank Bali sets US$50 mln FRCD.</title>
<headline>Bank Bali sets US$50 mln FRCD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by arranger United Overseas Bank.</p>
<p>BORROWER PT BANK BALI (CAYMAN ISLAND)</p>
<p> AMOUNT   US$50 MLN    COUPON    6ML+78BP    MATURITY  3 YRS</p>
<p> TYPE     FRCD	   ISS PRICE PAR	   LAUNCHED  30.SEP.96</p>
<p> PUTS     NONE	   CALLS     NONE	  REPLIES   04.OCT.96</p>
<p> LISTING  NONE	   REPAYMENT BULLET	DENOMS    US$250K</p>
<p> RATINGS  NONE	   SALE LMTS STANDARD    TAX PROV  --</p>
<p> NEG PLG  YES	    CRS DEF   YES	   FORCE MAJ --</p>
<p> HOME CTRY INDONESIA   GOV LAW   ENGLISH     PAY DATE  28.OCT.96</p>
<p>MGT LEVELS AND FEES</p>
<p>	   CO-ARRANGERS  US$4-5 MLN  43.5 BP  ALL-IN 92.5 BP</p>
<p>	   CO-LEAD MGRS  US$2-3 MLN  36   BP  ALL-IN 90   BP</p>
<p>ARRANGERS ARAB BANKING CORP SINGAPORE, SANWA INTERNATIONAL</p>
<p>	     FINANCE AND UNITED OVERSEAS BANK</p>
<p>--Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2847 4039</p>
</text>
